  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "都市更新",
    "sub_ename": "URBAN RENEWAL",
    "describe_ch": "本課程從都市更新的歷史、定義、理論、功能與原則等著手，並以我國都市更新條例為藍本，藉以建構都市計畫與都市更新的關係以及都市更新的規劃程序與規劃技術。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is intended to discuss the history, definition, theory, function, and principle of urban renewal, based on Urban Renewal Act which was enacted in 1998. Topics discussed also include the relationaship between urban planning and urban renewal.\r\n",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "能應用都市更新的理論、方法與程序",
      "describe_en": "Application for theories, methods, and processes of urban renewal."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "能分析都市更新問題並用創新思維解決問題",
      "describe_en": "Analysis of urban renewal problems and then providing solutions with innovative thinking.\r\n"
    }
